  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 880824,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Rocket.Chat's SAML SSO verified XML signatures but did not bind the validated signature to `samlp:Response` / `saml:Assertion`. An attacker could submit a wrapped document carrying forged identity attributes alongside any valid signature made by the trusted IdP certificate, and log in as an arbitrary user.",
